    <item>
      <title>参议员就格雷厄姆的法案达成协议以推进对俄罗斯的制裁</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/28/us/politics/senators-russia-sanctions-bill-graham.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[参议员们宣布这项长期停滞的措施取得了突破，并纪念了该法案的主要支持者林赛·格雷厄姆参议员。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/28/us/politics/senators-russia-sanctions-bill-graham.html</guid>
